+.. method:: jinja2.Environment.extract_translations_with_metadata(source, source_name=None)
+
+    Iterate over translation blocks that declare ``note``, ``created``,
+    or ``modified`` metadata. Each result contains the optional source
+    name, the block line number, a copied metadata mapping, and the
+    messages that the ordinary extractor finds in that block. Returned
+    records are independent, so callers may modify them without
+    affecting later extractions.
+
