    The ``trimmed`` and ``notrimmed`` modifiers have been added.
 
+Translation metadata
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+Translation blocks can carry string-literal ``note``, ``created``, and
+``modified`` metadata. These keys may be mixed with variables and
+whitespace modifiers, but each key may occur only once::
+
+    {% trans note="Shown on the account page", created="2024-01-01", user=user, trimmed %}
+      Hello, {{ user }}!
+    {% endtrans %}
+
+Metadata is intended for extraction tools. It does not affect rendering
+or the messages returned by the ordinary translation extractor.
+
 It's possible to translate strings in expressions with these functions:
 
 -   ``gettext``: translate a single string
